{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15106030","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15106030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1510603001:1":{"text":"狩猟神様、神使さん、また会えて嬉しいです。","source_cn":"狩猎神，小神使。我们又见面了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5485358919ED913E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"狩猟神様、神使さん、また会えて嬉しいです。","female":"狩猟神様、神使さん、また会えて嬉しいです。","variant_male_record_index":"174221","variant_female_record_index":"174222","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510603002:0":{"text":"モルガンさんはいないのですか？","source_cn":"只有梅林。摩根呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE26D7091985BE2E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510603003:1":{"text":"彼は豊穣神の所にいます。あそこは地形が複雑なので、彼に道を探ってもらっているのです。","source_cn":"他仍在丰饶神所在之处。那一带地势奇诡，需要有人打探前路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F4E2D21AA0F0EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1510603003":{"text":"彼は豊穣神の所にいます。あそこは地形が複雑なので、彼に道を探ってもらっているのです。","source_cn":"他仍在丰饶神所在之处。那一带地势奇诡，需要有人打探前路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F4E2D21AA0F0EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510603004:0":{"text":"ホーリンが天災に見舞われている期間と比べれば、一瞬のようなものです。","source_cn":"与呼临遭受天灾的时间相比，这只是很短的一瞬。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x219AB458A436F7E0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ホーリ